   "ruling": "Ruling: ambiguity; amb.2025.hsa_line7_months and amb.2025.hsa_step4_other_limits; i8889 p. 7, Line 6, Step 4; p. 5, Line 3, Note. Project $4,279.17 = Step 3 $3,562.50 (Step 1 $8,550 x 10/12 = $7,125, half to the spouse) + Step 4 $4,300 x 2/12 = $716.67 for the self-only months; under the owner's reading the $1,000 additional amount is on line 7 for all 12 eligible months. The model ($4,445.83) put $5,300 x 2/12 (the 55-or-older amount) in Step 4 and counted only the 10 family months on line 7: the recorded alternative pairing of amb.2025.hsa_line7_months. Not evidence for the project's reading; dropped. [dropped]"
